## 🗄️ Modelos de Base de Datos

### User

- `id` (PK, auto-increment)
- `name` (string, required)
- `email` (string, unique, required)
- `passwordHash` (string, required)
- `createdAt` (timestamp)
- `updatedAt` (timestamp)

### Group

- `id` (PK, auto-increment)
- `userId` (FK → User.id, required)
- `name` (string, required)
- `amountPerBirthday` (decimal, required) - Monto fijo por cumpleaños
- `description` (text, optional)
- `createdAt` (timestamp)
- `updatedAt` (timestamp)

### Member

- `id` (PK, auto-increment)
- `groupId` (FK → Group.id, required)
- `name` (string, required)
- `phone` (string, optional)
- `birthday` (date, required) - Fecha de cumpleaños (sin año)
- `photoUrl` (string, optional) - URL de foto del miembro
- `createdAt` (timestamp)
- `updatedAt` (timestamp)

### BirthdayEvent

- `id` (PK, auto-increment)
- `memberId` (FK → Member.id, required)
- `groupId` (FK → Group.id, required)
- `birthdayDate` (date, required) - Fecha completa del cumpleaños (con año actual)
- `expectedAmount` (decimal, required) - Monto esperado = miembros × amountPerBirthday
- `createdAt` (timestamp)
- `updatedAt` (timestamp)

### Payment

- `id` (PK, auto-increment)
- `birthdayEventId` (FK → BirthdayEvent.id, required)
- `memberId` (FK → Member.id, required) - Miembro que realiza el pago
- `amount` (decimal, required)
- `datePaid` (date, required)
- `proofUrl` (string, optional) - URL del comprobante (Cloudinary)
- `createdAt` (timestamp)
- `updatedAt` (timestamp)

### Relaciones

- User 1:N Group
- Group 1:N Member
- Group 1:N BirthdayEvent
- Member 1:N BirthdayEvent
- BirthdayEvent 1:N Payment
- Member 1:N Payment (como pagador)

